  "description": "All rental property enquiries must be submitted via Daft only, including full details for all applicants.\n\n***Secure private WIFI network and Domestic Waste collection included in monthly rent***\n\nPortobello living at its finest! A stunning refurbishment of this Period style building has delivered 2 stylish one-bedroom apartments back to the market, cleverly designed to maximise space and light. Fitted to a high specification complete with beautifully fitted kitchens (with full set of appliances including washing machine / dryer) and tastefully designed shower rooms. Presented in contemporary tones and finishes, you can count these among the trendiest apartments currently available in Dublin city. Enjoy the benefit of living within minutes of Stephen's Green, Grafton St, Trinity College as well as being within walking distance of Dublin's best theatres, hotels and restaurants as well as being centred in the very heart of Portobello and the Camden Quarter.\n\nViewing highly recommended.",
